    "\n\nWHY THIS PACK IS DIFFERENT\n• Privacy-friendly sign-in sheet: first name + last initial, no reason for visit on display\n• Vaccine fridge & freezer log with twice-daily min/max columns and typical CDC ranges printed on it\n"
